{"unit_id":"tag:03N4:prose-0002","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n这就“定义”了平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）拓扑（topology）。换言之，我们现在可以说明什么是层（sheaves）。一个 <TEXTITOPEN_0001>平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）层（sheaf）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001> <MATH_0001>，其值为集合（sets）（分别为<SPACE_0001>阿贝尔群（abelian groups）、向量空间（vector spaces）等），在 <MATH_0002> 上是如下数据：\n<STRUCT_0002>\n<STRUCT_0003> 对每个平展（<ACCENT_0003>tale）态射（morphism）<MATH_0003>，给定一个集合（set）（分别为<SPACE_0002>阿贝尔群（abelian group）、向量空间（vector space）等）<MATH_0004>；\n<STRUCT_0004> 对每一对 <MATH_0005>，它们是平展（<ACCENT_0004>tale）概形（schemes），位于 <MATH_0006> 上，以及每个态射（morphism）<MATH_0007>，它位于 <MATH_0008> 上（且自动是平展（<ACCENT_0005>tale）的），给定一个限制映射（map）\n<MATH_0009>。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n这些数据必须满足条件 <MATH_0010>，在恒等态射（identity morphism）<MATH_0011> 的情形下；并满足 <MATH_0012>，当有态射（morphisms）<MATH_0013>，其概形（schemes）平展（<ACCENT_0006>tale）于 <MATH_0014> 上时；还要满足如下 <TEXTITOPEN_0002>层（sheaf）公理<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>：\n<STRUCT_0006>\n<ITEMOPEN_0001>(*)<ITEMCLOSE_0001> 对每个平展（<ACCENT_0007>tale）覆盖（covering）<MATH_0015>，图（diagram）\n<MATH_0016>\n是等化子（equalizer）图（diagram），所在范畴（category）是集合（sets）（分别为<SPACE_0003>阿贝尔群（abelian groups）、向量空间（vector spaces）等）的范畴。\n<STRUCT_0007>\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"abelian groups","target_term":"阿贝尔群"},{"source_term":"vector spaces","target_term":"向量空间"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"abelian group","target_term":"阿贝尔群"},{"source_term":"vector space","target_term":"向量空间"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"限制映射"},{"source_term":"identity morphism","target_term":"恒等态射"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图"},{"source_term":"equalizer","target_term":"等化子"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"abelian groups","target_term":"阿贝尔群"},{"source_term":"vector spaces","target_term":"向量空间"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"abelian groups","target_term":"阿贝尔群","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"vector spaces","target_term":"向量空间","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"abelian group","target_term":"阿贝尔群","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"vector space","target_term":"向量空间","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"限制映射","context":"原文 restriction map，保留限制限定，暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"identity morphism","target_term":"恒等态射","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"equalizer","target_term":"等化子","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"暂定译法。"}],"notes":[]}
